exports[`the gallery > is a stable snapshot 1`] = `"<main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] px-5 pb-16 sm:px-16"><header class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-10"><h1 class="text-headline font-display font-semibold tracking-headline text-ink">Component gallery</h1><p class="text-body text-ink-2">Every component in the token sheet, in every state. Nothing here is a product screen and nothing here is linked from the app.</p></header><section class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-hairline py-10" id="tokens"><h2 class="text-title font-display font-semibold tracking-title text-ink">Colour tokens</h2><p class="text-secondary text-ink-2">Each token with its computed WCAG 2.x contrast ratio against canvas and against surface. The sheet declares a floor of 4.5 to 1. Three tokens do not clear it, which is why the state colours are indicators and never text, and why axis labels and the inactive tab label are ink-2.</p><ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-group border border-hairline p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 w-full rounded-field border border-hairline" style="background-color:#FFFFFF"></span><span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">canvas</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink-2">#FFFFFF</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on canvas 1.00:1</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on surface 1.09:1</span><span class="text-caption text-ink-2">page background</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-group border border-hairline p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 w-full rounded-field border border-hairline" style="background-color:#F4F5F7"></span><span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">surface</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink-2">#F4F5F7</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on canvas 1.09:1</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on surface 1.00:1</span><span class="text-caption text-ink-2">grouped sections, sheets, form fills</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-group border border-hairline p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 w-full rounded-field border border-hairline" style="background-color:#E4E6EA"></span><span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">hairline</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink-2">#E4E6EA</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on canvas 1.25:1</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on surface 1.15:1</span><span class="text-caption text-ink-2">all separation and depth, always 1px</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-group border border-hairline p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 w-full rounded-field border border-hairline" style="background-color:#000000"></span><span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">ink</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink-2">#000000</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on canvas 21.00:1</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on surface 19.25:1</span><span class="text-caption text-ink-2">text, primary actions</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-group border border-hairline p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 w-full rounded-field border border-hairline" style="background-color:#6B6F76"></span><span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">ink-2</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink-2">#6B6F76</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on canvas 5.05:1</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink">on surface 4.63:1</span><span class="text-caption text-ink-2">secondary text, labels, axis labels, inactive tab</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-group border border-hairline p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 w-full rounded-field border border-hairline" style="background-color:#A3A7AE"></span><span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">ink-3</span><span class="text-caption tabular-nums text-ink-2">#A3A7AE</span><