pan></span><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end gap-2 text-right text-body text-ink">Computer and mathematical</span></div><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 min-h-[52px]"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5 text-left"><span class="text-secondary text-ink-2">Monthly payment</span></span><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end gap-2 text-right text-body text-ink">28.00</span></div><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 min-h-[52px]"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5 text-left"><span class="text-secondary text-ink-2">Pays from</span></span><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end gap-2 text-right text-body text-ink">0xcad3…b6f5</span></div></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-secondary text-ink-2">Demo wallet. Testnet only.</p><div class="mt-4"><button class="relative inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-6 text-button font-medium transition-opacity duration-200 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none bg-ink text-canvas" type="button"><span>Pay 28.00</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-caption text-ink-2">Grabber 36 by 4 and the scrim at rgba(0,0,0,0.32)</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-1 w-9 rounded-full bg-hairline"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-16 w-full rounded-field" style="background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.32)"></span></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-hairline py-10" id="display-number"><h2 class="text-title font-display font-semibold tracking-title text-ink">Display number</h2><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-caption text-ink-2">display-xl</p><span class="text-display-xl font-display font-semibold tracking-display tabular-nums text-ink" data-testid="display-number">5,000</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-capt