nt-semibold tracking-title text-ink">Status pill</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white/78 px-2.5 py-[5px] text-caption font-medium text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-covered"></span>Covered</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white/78 px-2.5 py-[5px] text-caption font-medium text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-watch"></span>Claims open</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white/78 px-2.5 py-[5px] text-caption font-medium text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-triggered"></span>Paid out</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white/78 px-2.5 py-[5px] text-caption font-medium text-ink-2">Cover ended</span></div><p class="text-secondary text-ink-2">The dot is the state colour and the label is ink. No state colour is used as the colour of a string a person has to read.</p></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-hairline py-10" id="tab-bar"><h2 class="text-title font-display font-semibold tracking-title text-ink">Tab bar</h2><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-caption text-ink-2">Cover active</p><div class="w-full max-w-[390px] border border-hairline"><nav aria-label="Sections" class="flex h-20 items-start border-t border-hairline bg-canvas"><button aria-current="page" class="flex min-h-11 flex-1 items-center justify-center pt-4 text-secondary font-medium text-ink" type="button">Cover</button><button class="flex min-h-11 flex-1 items-center justify-center pt-4 text-secondary font-medium text-ink-2" type="button">Index</button></nav></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-caption text-ink-2">Index active</p><div class="w-full max-w-