lay: Jul 2026</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-caption text-ink-2">Full, sticky at the top of a public page</p><div class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-[52px] w-full flex-col justify-center border-b border-hairline bg-surface px-5 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-secondary font-medium text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-watch"></span>Replay: Jul 2026</span><span class="text-caption text-ink-2">Months are replayed at ten seconds each.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-hairline py-10" id="wallet"><h2 class="text-title font-display font-semibold tracking-title text-ink">Wallet</h2><p class="text-secondary text-ink-2">The worker flow shows the wallet exactly once, in the Pay sheet, as the Pays from row. No network name, no gas, no transaction hash. The demo mode is labelled wherever it shows.</p><div class="max-w-[390px]"><div class="rounded-group bg-surface px-4"><div class="divide-y divide-hairline"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 min-h-[52px]"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5 text-left"><span class="text-secondary text-ink-2">Pays from</span></span><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end gap-2 text-right text-body text-ink">0xcad3…b6f5</span></div></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-secondary text-ink-2">Demo wallet. Testnet only.</p></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-hairline py-10" id="frame"><h2 class="text-title font-display font-semibold tracking-title text-ink">Desktop frame</h2><p class="text-secondary text-ink-2">The tab bar is a mobile pattern. On a wide viewport the 390 column stays a column: it stands on the surface ground under the product&#x27;s header, as a canvas sheet with hairline sides, the same construction the investor frame uses at 1280.</p><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col"><header class="border-b border-hairline bg-canvas px-5 lg:px-